feat: full trybox CLI — init, gateway, driver, PKI generation

Rewrote cli.py to handle the full end-to-end flow:
- trybox init: generates TLS PKI (CA, server, client, JWT Ed25519)
  at ~/.local/share/trybox/tls/ and writes gateway.toml
- trybox gateway start|stop|status: manages openshell-gateway
  with TLS + JWT + mTLS client_ca_path
- trybox driver start: passes --gateway-port 17671, --host-tls-*,
  --allow-same-uid-peer flags needed for host supervisor mTLS
- trybox <name>: ensures driver + gateway running, creates try dir,
  registers + selects the trybox gateway, creates sandbox, connects
- Default try path: ~/code/tries (matching Brad's setup)
- Gateway port 17671, TLS endpoint https://127.0.0.1:17671
